          <h3>Norris Green Village New Builds</h3>
          <p>The post-2011 rebuild by Countryside Properties and Sigma put up 829 new homes on the old Boot Estate site. Modern push-fit plumbing, fresh combi boilers, mains pressure systems. Many are still under maker warranty.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
