      <div class="jobs-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Boiler Pressure Loss</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Slow pressure loss is the most common Norris Green call. The system drops from 1.5 bar to below 0.5 bar over days or weeks. Small leak somewhere. We find the source and fix it on the first visit. Topping it up again and again hides the real problem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Old System Boiler Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Many original 1930s semis still run a system boiler and a hot water cylinder. Pumps fail. Three-port valves stick. The cylinder thermostat dies. We carry common spares on the van. Same-visit fix in most cases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>New-Build Push-Fit Joint Leaks</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>The Norris Green Village new builds use plastic push-fit plumbing. The joints can pop if installed badly or knocked during other work. A failed joint releases water fast. We carry the common push-fit fittings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>1930s Drainage Blockages</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>The original clay drain runs are now 90 years old. Lead joint seals fail. Ground movement cracks pipes. Tree roots find their way in. We clear with high-pressure jetting. CCTV survey on request.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Right-to-Buy Mixed Pipework</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>Right-to-buy homes have been upgraded piecemeal over decades. Lead pipe meets copper meets plastic in unexpected places. Joins fail. We work out what's there and fix the failed section properly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Burst Pipes in Cold Snaps</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">15 min response</span></div>
          <p>The older lofts aren't always well insulated. Cold weeks each winter cause pipe bursts above ceilings. We attend 24/7. We can lag the pipes on the same visit to stop it happening again next year.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
